- `v-else` ensures the child component only renders when data is available
- The child component receives the data via `:user-data="data"`
- `defineProps` declares the expected prop in the child
- The parent handles loading/error states before passing data down

This pattern keeps the child component simple and focused on rendering, while the parent handles the data fetching logic.

